      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.05,
      "end_seconds": 252.55,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse is 72 beats a minute, BP is 120 over 70, weight 53 kilos, temp 36.9 degrees, height 178 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.31,
      "end_seconds": 255.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.34,
      "end_seconds": 284.11,
      "duration_seconds": 26.77,
      "text": "I'll come back to those numbers. So, based on your history, this is probably an underactive thyroid. I wanna be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. We shouldn't forget depression. I'm gonna order a thyroid test, for hypothyroid symptoms. I'd like to arrange blood tests for fatigue. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.77,
      "end_seconds": 287.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.13,
      "end_seconds": 300.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.97,
      "text": "Let's use levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach, until we review. You take it it by mouth. That should help with hypothyroidism."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.63,
      "end_seconds": 303.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "okay, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.21,
      "end_seconds": 317.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "Take the thyroid tablet on an empty stomach, half an hour before breakfast, and not with calcium or iron. I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.01,
      "end_seconds": 320.98,
